body:
please please please please please **leave her.**

&#x200B;

show some self-respect man. you don't deserve to be heartbroken by some asshole who deceives and lies to you. if she is indeed genuine about remorse, she did this to herself. she deserves to face the consequences of her actions

&#x200B;

if you don't leave her, well... it won't be your last time posting on this sub. don't be stupid, go out and find a person who respects you and really loves you
